      "content": "it's not just the cold. it's the pointlessness of it. even if i make it to the shelter, what then? another day of scavenging in the ruins? another day of watching everything i ever cared about turn to dust? i'm just a ghost walking through a graveyard. i feel like i'm already gone.",
